# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-25231acc498299ac2150db867ab791a9466ac2b8 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked, reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline [[cite:obs-a751cb0e6279862520a6c010eadf283709a2ac7b "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].
